{%- comment -%}
  The single free-shipping progress line, shared by the homepage shipping
  bar, the cart drawer/page and the PDP cross-sell so the empty-cart /
  reached cases stay in one place. Server-rendered from the cart; callers
  that need it live re-render the text on Dawn's cartUpdate pub/sub.

  Gated on the single theme setting settings.show_free_shipping (default
  false) — the €50 figure baked into every caller doesn't match the live
  store rule (Spain free >= €55, PT/rest of EU pay a flat €8.99, no
  threshold). Renders nothing while the flag is off; flip it on once the
  merchant confirms the real shipping rule and the callers' hardcoded
  threshold_amount values are updated to match. This is the ONLY switch —
  don't reintroduce a second one (e.g. commented-out code) here or at a
  call site.

  Accepts:
  - threshold_amount: {Number} in store currency (e.g. 50 = €50). Default 50.
  - reached_text:     {String} shown once the threshold is met. Optional.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.show_free_shipping -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign fsl_threshold = threshold_amount | default: 50 | times: 100
    assign fsl_remaining = fsl_threshold | minus: cart.total_price
    if fsl_remaining < 0
      assign fsl_remaining = 0
    endif
    assign fsl_remaining_money = fsl_remaining | money
    assign fsl_threshold_money = fsl_threshold | money
    assign fsl_empty = false
    if cart == empty or cart.item_count == 0
      assign fsl_empty = true
    endif
  -%}
  {%- if fsl_empty -%}
    {{- 'sections.shipping_bar.empty' | t: threshold: fsl_threshold_money -}}
  {%- elsif fsl_remaining > 0 -%}
    {{- 'sections.shipping_bar.remaining' | t: amount: fsl_remaining_money, threshold: fsl_threshold_money -}}
  {%- elsif reached_text != blank -%}
    {{- reached_text | escape -}}
  {%- else -%}
    {{- 'sections.pdp.xsell_unlocked' | t -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
